{"reviewId": "40739108_8470bbSzJ", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "周金涛的研究把第五次康波的“萧条期”界定为​​2016—2025年​​左右。他指出，2016年前后商品价格出现一次超跌反弹，标志着衰退已触底并开始进入萧条阶段，而黄金价格正是在这之后步入长达五六年的牛市，并在萧条期的中后期（大约2020—2025年）迎来涨幅最大的“超级行情”。因此，文中所说的“萧条期”主要指​​2016年至2025年这段时间​​。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "以此为起点，黄金资产价格将步入长期牛市，并且在萧条期5～10年的超级行情中达到高潮。", "range": "2773-2815", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "40739108_8470bbSzJ", "userVid": 40739108, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761205070, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 40739108, "name": "🦁vivian 🦁", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/zjKG0vP8r38kHksAmWmlpmlDUScBlNjdPbj3QuYoLWJMrmyPicyxM3gt2Ok2DWh2qCGMEibkAJZo4xWF8xCTOyDw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 73091896, "name": "随喜", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/dmy8r6lty2PxlDbRfJ9vdSzT9PhW2saHtbPy3BS69sIOv775YfZP9p8taSCNeib9qyJbRAfwNbOex3VLVDQQiao0HCV9KYWs8BZbzvHdaicnpE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "疫情如何影响呢\n", "reviewId": "40739108_8470bbSzJ", "commentId": "40739108_8470bbSzJ_c2058852_86uoMQljP", "userVid": 2058852, "createTime": 1769577248, "likesCount": 0, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 2058852, "n